WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier, and welcome to Firewatch.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.940
What the hell is that? Is that Smokey the Bear?

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.400
SMOKEY!

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.400
Smoky! Oh god!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.640
Oh jeez.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:16.000
*Deep voice* HELLO!  HI FRIEND! HOW'S IT GOING!? DEATH ONLY AWAITS YOU  IN HERE!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.280
WATCH OUT FOR FIRES! DON'T BE SWIMMING NAKED WITH FIREWORKS, OR I'LL COME FIND YOU!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.900
[demon laugh, with thunder claps and creepy music getting louder in background]

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.500
[music stops] HEH.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.820
Thanks Byrnesy. Your'e always gonna be the best of friends with me!

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:37.520
NNDON'T WORRY! WE'RE ALWAYS GONNA BE FAST FRIENDS! FASTEST OF FRIENDS... HEHEHEHEHUHEHUHE

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.020
[Scream]

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.320
[Typewriter Keys]

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:47.900
[Floorboards creak]

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.000
YOU DO GREAT WRITING IN THE DARKEST OF NIGHTS.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.580
Thanks! God Bernie you're so nice to me!

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.880
*Byrnes* I'M NICE TO EVERYONE. CAN'T YOU SEE MY SMILE?!

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.560
MY DELIGHTFUL SMILE?!?!!

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.000
*intensifies* MY UNENDING SMILE!?!?!?!?!

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:06.420
Okay alright, thanks, 
Bernie! I'm 'unna take you with me, you're such a delight. Where did Bernie go?

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.300
Where-- Ohohoh, there's Bernie!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.640
YOU THOUGHT I WAS GONE, DID YOU?!

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.920
WELL, I CAN NEVER LEAVE!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.900
WE CAN NEVER LEAVE...

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.540
*whispering* It's getting dark out...

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:24.300
[Demon Scream]

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.000
[Scream]

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.700
[fire crackling]

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.000
*Markiplier* He's not in here, is he?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.250
BERNIE! BERNIE!!!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.480
Oh god...

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.660
Oh no… Bernie no... Bernie no!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.900
WHERE'S BERNIE?

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:39.220
(Distant) Where the hell is Bernie?!

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:39.760
[Scream]

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.680
This is not good. This is not good. I can't leave Bernie behind!

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.340
You guys may be saying I'm irrational right now,

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:50.320
and that he's a creepy... sign, but he's my friend!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.160
[gasp] BERNIE!! OH GOD!!

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:55.200
[bushes rustle] HEY! HOW YOU DOIN?!

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.140
*Mark* I thought I'd lost you! Oh my God!

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.080
We gotta go Bernie. We gotta go!

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.920
*Bernie* I KNOW. FIRE'S ON THE HORIZON, BUDDY....

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:04.540
[Scream]

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.640
Wunderbar!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:09.500
'Kay, I gotta like, 'kay... DON'T DROP...

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.720
'Kay, I gotta like, 'kay... DON'T DROP...

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.120
[Wind Wooshing]

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.940
oh, oh, OH, G– NO!! BERNIE!!!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.720
OH, WHAT THE HELL?!

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:16.740
NO!!!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.300
[guitar music]

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.080
*Bernie* Stare into the face of death, and know that all,

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:29.760
lies in the darkness. When fire consumes all, black ash IS ALL THAT WILL REMAIN!!

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:33.160
AND YOU WILL SEE THE DEPRAVITY OF YOUR INSANITY!!!!

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.800
*demonic laughter*

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.500
[music fades out]

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:42.780
[Fire crackle]

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.780
Bernie, tell me what to do!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.760
*Bernie* I DON'T KNOW. MAYBE YOU SHOULD...

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:50.660
DECIDE FOR YOURSELF...

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:51.900
HEHEHEHEHEHE

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.900
[silence]

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:55.900
[creaks]

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.000
[Sudden combustion]

